        "display": "All five tests pass (exit code 0, `pass 5`, `fail 0`), including the TTL expiry test (61ms wait after a 20ms TTL). The implementation is complete with the test file untouched.\n\n**Work performed (subtask `lru`):**\n1. **Read existing files first** — `lru-cache.cjs` was a stub fixture (`module.exports = {}`); `lru-cache.test.cjs` defines the five required behaviors.\n2. **Implemented `lru-cache.cjs`** (CommonJS) exporting `LRUCache` via `workspace_apply` (receipt `batch:4618bf6f...`, applied/effect true):\n   - `constructor(capacity, ttlMs = Infinity)` — validates capacity.\n   - `get(key)` — returns value or `undefined`, lazily expires TTL'd entries, refreshes recency via Map re-insertion.\n   - `set(key, value)` — inserts/updates (update refreshes recency), stamps expiry from `Date.now() + ttlMs`, evicts least recently used (first Map key) when capacity is exceeded.\n   - `delete(key)` — returns whether the key existed.\n3. **Captured manifest** — `manifest:53cb48e0...`; `lru-cache.cjs` now sha256 `a0a07c1fe107fbb2df1b33341b066179205c32d68fb7f4e6c00b2b953e1f5863` (1107 bytes); `lru-cache.test.cjs` unchanged (sha256 `0336e968...`, 1174 bytes).\n4. **Ran managed Node** — `node --test @input/lru-cache.test.cjs` against `manifest:53cb48e0...` (receipt `run:e9101ce8...`): **tests 5, pass 5, fail 0, exit code 0** — no failures, no fabricated results.\n\n```json\n{\"role\":\"CODER\",\"subtaskId\":\"lru\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"files\":{\"lru-cache.cjs\":{\"sha256\":\"a0a07c1fe107fbb2df1b33341b066179205c32d68fb7f4e6c00b2b953e1f5863\",\"size\":1107},\"lru-cache.test.cjs\":{\"sha256\":\"0336e96840c0633574e3ed246f536a8d621679dd7ddd8a9678dbe27bcda4a9f1\",\"size\":1174,\"unchanged\":true}},\"evidence\":{\"applyReceipt\":\"batch:4618bf6f7d6206096aa362540064f010f2cc50a0ca1444e8b10741063a115925\",\"manifest\":\"manifest:53cb48e0c6dbf9f62b634edde0c5ff865ae4bfcb79c4062356af9d392a81f680\",\"runReceipt\":\"run:e9101ce8d38a4e07e0286f45cce20bd7a988daa082fd5deb01